    description: "Found by the 2026-10-05 docstring staleness audit (reviewer reproduced): 'foo :: Int -> Int' then 'foo x = x' yields Main.foo twice, at 3-3 with signature 'Int -> Int' and at 4-4 with None. Fix: merge into one symbol whichever node comes first; remove the no-cover pragma and test both orders."  # 15bc
    fields:  # 15bc
      statement: "One declaration produces one symbol."  # 15bc
      root_cause: "The signature branch (~L274-293) creates a function symbol, and the function branch (~L238-256) creates another; only the signature branch checks for an existing symbol (~L267), and that update path is pragma: no cover, so it never runs in tests."  # 15bc
